{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_153_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_153","textTraditional":"一、三年。春，楚公子嬰齊帥師伐吳。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_153_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_153","textTraditional":"二、公如晉。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_153_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_153","textTraditional":"三、夏四月壬戌，公及晉侯盟于長樗。公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_153_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_153","textTraditional":"四、六月，公會單子、晉侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、莒子、邾婁子、齊世子光；己未，同盟于雞澤。陳侯使袁僑如會。戊寅，叔孫豹及諸侯之大夫及陳袁僑盟。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_153_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_153","textTraditional":"其言如會何？後會也。曷為殊及陳袁僑？為其與袁僑盟也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_153_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_153","textTraditional":"五、秋，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_153_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_153","textTraditional":"六、冬，晉荀罃帥師伐許。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}